{"text": "什么是周年申报表？", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_ca035186e86e58318737ced4", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 16, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n什么是周年申报表？", "prev_chunk_id": "H_6dafbd3c1eebbf78647c8e96", "next_chunk_id": "H_0925b04347bd4647def43ace"}
{"text": "周年申报表是一份具指明格式的申报表，载列截至申报表制备日期为止的公司资料，例如注册办事处地址、股东、董事和公司秘书的资料。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_0925b04347bd4647def43ace", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 17, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n周年申报表是一份具指明格式的申报表，载列截至申报表制备日期为止的公司资料，例如注册办事处地址、股东、董事和公司秘书的资料。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_ca035186e86e58318737ced4", "next_chunk_id": "H_e63c57b996e10866fa56c431"}
