{"text": "根据《公司条例》注册的公司何时须要交付周年申报表登记？", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_ce8a70e30562e87bba8d7ce9", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 19, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n根据《公司条例》注册的公司何时须要交付周年申报表登记？", "prev_chunk_id": "H_e63c57b996e10866fa56c431", "next_chunk_id": "H_1514e6901c55f1c7587c6179"}
{"text": "本地私人公司须就每一年(成立为法团当年除外)于成立为法团之周年日后的42日内，交付周年申报表登记。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_1514e6901c55f1c7587c6179", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 20, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n本地私人公司须就每一年(成立为法团当年除外)于成立为法团之周年日后的42日内，交付周年申报表登记。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_ce8a70e30562e87bba8d7ce9", "next_chunk_id": "H_ae548637200ba50b2c7aa3a4"}
{"text": "其他本地公司则须于公司的申报表日期后的42日内交付周年申报表登记。申报表日期视乎公司的类别而定。详情请参阅本处网站的「常见问题」- 「本地有限公司」- 「周年申报表」。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_ae548637200ba50b2c7aa3a4", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 21, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n其他本地公司则须于公司的申报表日期后的42日内交付周年申报表登记。申报表日期视乎公司的类别而定。详情请参阅本处网站的「常见问题」- 「本地有限公司」- 「周年申报表」。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_1514e6901c55f1c7587c6179", "next_chunk_id": "H_f8e6db8cd41e571de644c2ce"}
{"text": "注册非香港公司则须于公司在香港注册的每个周年日后的42日内，交付周年申报表登记。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_f8e6db8cd41e571de644c2ce", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 22, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n注册非香港公司则须于公司在香港注册的每个周年日后的42日内，交付周年申报表登记。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_ae548637200ba50b2c7aa3a4", "next_chunk_id": "H_b41c0aa4ef156dc5550ca01d"}
