{"text": "什么是「周年申报表e提示」服务？", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_0f90147549f050d7c1f53775", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 33, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n什么是「周年申报表e提示」服务？", "prev_chunk_id": "H_82be5d7e0ea0975a8e8f2720", "next_chunk_id": "H_c77e8def48d57e513c62b9a1"}
{"text": "「周年申报表e提示」服务 (「e提示服务」) 是本处在「电子服务网站」免费提供的一项简单易用的服务。提示公司交付周年申报表的电子通知书会由系统发送到用户的信息匣及登记电邮地址。用户可即时点击通知书内的超连结接达「电子服务网站」，以电子方式提交周年申报表（电子表格NAR1或NN3）。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_c77e8def48d57e513c62b9a1", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 34, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n「周年申报表e提示」服务 (「e提示服务」) 是本处在「电子服务网站」免费提供的一项简单易用的服务。提示公司交付周年申报表的电子通知书会由系统发送到用户的信息匣及登记电邮地址。用户可即时点击通知书内的超连结接达「电子服务网站」，以电子方式提交周年申报表（电子表格NAR1或NN3）。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_0f90147549f050d7c1f53775", "next_chunk_id": "H_623723c484ca2469b9297fcd"}
{"text": "任何已经在「电子服务网站」登记成为公司用户的下列类别的公司，会自动收到提示公司交付周年申报表的电子通知书：", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_623723c484ca2469b9297fcd", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 35, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n任何已经在「电子服务网站」登记成为公司用户的下列类别的公司，会自动收到提示公司交付周年申报表的电子通知书：", "prev_chunk_id": "H_c77e8def48d57e513c62b9a1", "next_chunk_id": "H_617ff42ecd2b7aa21adad897"}
{"text": "本地私人公司；", "block_type": "list", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_617ff42ecd2b7aa21adad897", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 36, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n本地私人公司；", "prev_chunk_id": "H_623723c484ca2469b9297fcd", "next_chunk_id": "H_3a403ce77a23096a365652e6"}
{"text": "本地公众公司或担保有限公司(如公司注册处已备存公司的会计参照期的纪录)；及", "block_type": "list", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_3a403ce77a23096a365652e6", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 37, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n本地公众公司或担保有限公司(如公司注册处已备存公司的会计参照期的纪录)；及", "prev_chunk_id": "H_617ff42ecd2b7aa21adad897", "next_chunk_id": "H_8929b77259a5cdcaed260335"}
{"text": "注册非香港公司。", "block_type": "list", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_8929b77259a5cdcaed260335", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 38, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n注册非香港公司。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_3a403ce77a23096a365652e6", "next_chunk_id": "H_a550619ea8cd69cb0e6ffcea"}
{"text": "任何已经在「电子服务网站」登记的个人用户，可就与其建立了用户联系的公司用户，免费订用e 提示服务，以收取提示有关公司交付周年申报表的电子通知书。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_a550619ea8cd69cb0e6ffcea", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 39, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n任何已经在「电子服务网站」登记的个人用户，可就与其建立了用户联系的公司用户，免费订用e 提示服务，以收取提示有关公司交付周年申报表的电子通知书。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_8929b77259a5cdcaed260335", "next_chunk_id": "H_ab89c489a9285f4f87dedc7b"}
{"text": "如属本地私人公司或注册非香港公司，系统会分别于公司成立为法团或公司在香港注册的周年日当日发送电子通知书。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_ab89c489a9285f4f87dedc7b", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 40, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n如属本地私人公司或注册非香港公司，系统会分别于公司成立为法团或公司在香港注册的周年日当日发送电子通知书。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_a550619ea8cd69cb0e6ffcea", "next_chunk_id": "H_8908bfad98f451ba194d8f58"}
{"text": "如属本地公众公司或担保有限公司，订户会于以下日期收到电子通知书：", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_8908bfad98f451ba194d8f58", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 41, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n如属本地公众公司或担保有限公司，订户会于以下日期收到电子通知书：", "prev_chunk_id": "H_ab89c489a9285f4f87dedc7b", "next_chunk_id": "H_0314b8a3226eb3105adb936e"}
{"text": "订户于订用e提示服务时所指明的日期当日；或", "block_type": "list", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_0314b8a3226eb3105adb936e", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 42, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n订户于订用e提示服务时所指明的日期当日；或", "prev_chunk_id": "H_8908bfad98f451ba194d8f58", "next_chunk_id": "H_f0bd9ea455bd548b307ccb7a"}
{"text": "如公司注册处已备存该公司的会计参照期的纪录，于公司的周年申报表的结算日期当日，即会计参照期结束后的6个月(公众公司)或9个月(担保有限公司)(以适用者为准)。", "block_type": "list", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_f0bd9ea455bd548b307ccb7a", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 43, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n如公司注册处已备存该公司的会计参照期的纪录，于公司的周年申报表的结算日期当日，即会计参照期结束后的6个月(公众公司)或9个月(担保有限公司)(以适用者为准)。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_0314b8a3226eb3105adb936e", "next_chunk_id": "H_5a09f162279e83c180054b74"}
