{"text": "如我无力缴纳法院判定的罚款，有什么办法可以解决？", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_0d387d134428740a0e1d1318", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 68, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n如我无力缴纳法院判定的罚款，有什么办法可以解决？", "prev_chunk_id": "H_9a32ea0c578fb16e7148d102", "next_chunk_id": "H_34ffb13d148b7b3b3a7ed75b"}
{"text": "裁判官在宣判时会询问你何时可以缴纳罚款，你可以向裁判官要求延长缴纳罚款的期限，或是以分期方式缴纳。裁判官会视乎你的情况作出适当决定。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_34ffb13d148b7b3b3a7ed75b", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 69, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n裁判官在宣判时会询问你何时可以缴纳罚款，你可以向裁判官要求延长缴纳罚款的期限，或是以分期方式缴纳。裁判官会视乎你的情况作出适当决定。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_0d387d134428740a0e1d1318", "next_chunk_id": "H_6bb54060a51ad74016d8e2c2"}
