{"text": "公司何时须要向公司注册处处长申报更改公司名称？", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_aaa9a33f935e54736f4e598e", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 71, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n公司何时须要向公司注册处处长申报更改公司名称？", "prev_chunk_id": "H_6bb54060a51ad74016d8e2c2", "next_chunk_id": "H_f9ea53d36da3f81c35d65ce1"}
{"text": "公司应在更改名称的特别决议获通过后的15日内，向公司注册处处长交付表格NNC2-「更改公司名称通知书」及所须费用。更改名称将由「公司更改名称证明书」的签发日期起生效。", "block_type": "paragraph", "section": "遵从法规", "chunk_id": "H_f9ea53d36da3f81c35d65ce1", "source_id": "d33282dfdc01677cc0006ed81a5e86c44ef7363e3a86d54f2e4655bdafa26cc2", "pages": [], "location": {"element_order": 72, "section": "遵从法规"}, "bboxes": [], "quote_match": null, "quality_flags": ["html_structure_requires_review"], "retrieval_text": "[Section]\n遵从法规\n[Content]\n公司应在更改名称的特别决议获通过后的15日内，向公司注册处处长交付表格NNC2-「更改公司名称通知书」及所须费用。更改名称将由「公司更改名称证明书」的签发日期起生效。", "prev_chunk_id": "H_aaa9a33f935e54736f4e598e", "next_chunk_id": "H_94051af0042b08be032f5447"}
